      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/76d3ee/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2018-07-02T19:06:20.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hello, the last day my doorbell has rung.&nbsp;</p><p>There was an old guy in front of me as I opened the door, he wore a religious black frock and he had two glass eyes.&nbsp;</p><p>All I heard was gibberish, the words „the end is nigh“ and after a while he said the word „OblivAeon“.&nbsp;</p><p>Well, he gave me a package which contained OblivAeon.&nbsp;</p><p>Then he made a cartwheel as he said goodbye.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Anyway, Handelabra said that Mini-Pack 4 will be released as the first persons receive their shipment:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/handelabra/sentinels-of-the-multiverse-the-video-game-season/posts/2213929\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/handelabra/sentinels-of-the-multiverse-the-video-game-season/posts/2213929</a></p><p>Here I am.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span>I would post a picture including all the content as a proof but a meteor crashed my house and the whole collection was burned.</span></p><div>&nbsp;</div>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:51:27.033Z",
